{"id":523,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"キリスト教教育と自立を支える立教女学院","feature_description":"立教女学院はキリスト教に基づく女子教育を通じ、深い学びと豊かな人間性を育みます。知識を自分のためだけに使うのではなく、他者や社会のために生かす姿勢を大切にし、国際的な教養、宗教的情操、自主性・自立性を伸ばします。中学校では教科学習や自治活動、クラブ活動を通して、自ら考え行動する経験を重ねます。中1は5月から生徒ホールを利用でき、それまでは弁当が基本です。","clubs":[{"id":10273,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10274,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10275,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10276,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10277,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10278,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10279,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10280,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10281,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10282,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10284,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10285,"name":"器楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.rikkyojogakuin.ac.jp/school-life/j_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10286